          "Reliance on policy language only.",
          "Requires explicit confirmation note citing the specific exclusion and its applicability to the claim type.",
          "Claims Adjuster",
          "Documentation completeness: 100%"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": "Implementation and Training Metrics"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": "Successful rollout requires adherence to the revised training modules. We anticipate that the availability of these consolidated job aids will reduce knowledge transfer time for new hires by an estimated 30%, significantly improving time-to-productivity metrics across the enterprise. Managers are responsible for documenting staff sign-offs on the following critical updates:"
    },
    {
      "type": "ol",
      "items": [
        "Confirmation of understanding regarding updated fraud detection metrics (Suspicion Index v3.1).",
        "Mastery of the new claims pairing workflow (Severity Code Integration).",
        "Review and sign-off on revised compliance reporting requirements (State-specific filing changes)."
      ]
    }
  ]
