      "type": "p",
      "content": "The Q4 strategy centers on three pillars: vendor diversification to mitigate single-point failures, the implementation of AI-driven spend analysis, and the formalization of sustainability criteria in vendor selection (ESG). Key successes from Q3 provided strong leverage, particularly in cloud infrastructure and data analytics tools. However, geopolitical instability suggests an increased need for resilience planning in sourcing critical niche services, such as specialized reinsurance capacity and cybersecurity consulting."
