      "title": "Risk Mitigation and Compliance Workflow",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "content": "Compliance mandates are non-negotiable. The CMS incorporates granular, role-based access controls (RBAC) and mandated workflow gates that cannot be bypassed. Every change is automatically timestamped, audited, and attributed, creating an unimpeachable compliance trail."
