        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Stakeholder Adoption and Implementation Phasing",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "content": "Successful adoption requires strategic phasing. We recommend a pilot approach starting with a single, high-volume, stable product line (e.g., Standard Auto Policy) before scaling across the full portfolio. This minimizes organizational risk while proving immediate ROI."
