      "title": "The User Experience: Content Authoring & Collaboration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "content": "We have designed the authoring interface for both technical content experts and non-technical compliance officers. The system supports structured content authoring, ensuring that templates are followed and mandated disclosures are never missed."
